---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Zinc and a note on AI: a project of several years and many failures, made possible by intensive AI help, with human direction and hardware tests.">
  <div class="wrap page-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>A note on AI</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-bottom:72px;max-width:760px">
    <p class="lead">Zinc has been a project of several years, and of many failures: attempts that went nowhere, designs that had to be thrown away. It exists today thanks to intensive help from AI.</p>
    <p>A large part of the code, tests and documentation of Zinc Next was written with AI coding agents, working through a backlog of precise tasks under rules a person sets and checks: <a href="https://github.com/Frulko/zinc/blob/main/AGENTS.md">AGENTS.md</a> and <a href="https://github.com/Frulko/zinc/blob/main/RULES.md">RULES.md</a> are the instructions they follow.</p>
    <p>The direction, the design choices and the tests on real hardware stay human. Mistakes remain possible; every behaviour is meant to be proven by a test, and reports of what is wrong are welcome.</p>
    <p><a class="btn primary" href="https://github.com/Frulko/zinc/issues">Report an issue</a> <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/Frulko/zinc">Source on GitHub</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
